=[ Crates API Reference ]

API documentation for crates in the `tomet-shelf` workspace, generated by `twrit api`.

==[ CLI Application ]

-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-cli") -- Command-line interface for building and serving Tomet vaults.

==[ Core Libraries ]

-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-headless") -- Headless static site generation engine and build pipeline.
-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-render") -- Tomet AST rendering, block transforms, and template engine contracts.
-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-route") -- Document routing, URL slugification, and path mapping.
-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-search") -- Client-side search index generation.
-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-serve") -- Embedded development server with live reload.
-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-config") -- Configuration types and parser for `shelf.toml`.

==[ Theme and Presentation ]

-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-template") -- MiniJinja HTML template renderer implementation.
-| @link(ref:"tomet-shelf-assets") -- Embedded frontend assets, styling, and scripts.
